<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>No darkness have we who in Jesus abide,</l><l>The light of the world is Jesus;</l><l>We walk in the light when we follow our Guide,</l><l>The light of the world is Jesus.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Ye dwellers in darkness with sin-blinded eyes,</l><l>The light of the world is Jesus;</l><l>Go, wash, at His bidding, and light will arise;</l><l>The light of the world is Jesus.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
